{"version":1,"key":"quest:166","content":{"id":166,"title":"navigator.sendBeacon，这个方法的作用和使用场景","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:166","type":"quest","id":166},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"页面卸载时用 sendBeacon 可靠上报数据","meta":"","excerpt":"在页面关闭或跳转时上报数据是前端常见的需求，比如埋点统计、错误日志等。传统的 XMLHttpRequest 或 fetch 在页面卸载阶段往往来不及发出，或者会阻塞页面跳转，影响用户体验。为了解决这个问题，浏览器提供了 navigator.sendBeacon(url, data) 这个 API。 url：数据发送的目","target":{"key":"card:730","type":"card","id":730},"citeKey":"card:730"}],"trail":[{"time":1778138687643,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1779181641932,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1779184528905,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1778138687643,"updateTime":1778138687643,"resolvedTime":1779184528905},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1778138687643}}